---

Ethervolt supplies electricity to much of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. It has lately been spending capital in ways that do not fit it, with a spike in recent weeks. [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] has named it to [[People/Benny|Benny]] as one of two companies worth looking into, the other being [[Org/Alkahest Freight/index|Alkahest Freight]].

Ethervolt called the Calarian council to convene a vote to oust [[Org/Concordia/index|Concordia]] from it, and believed it had the votes to carry the removal. One of the companies that had agreed to vote with Ethervolt abstained at the last moment, deadlocking the vote; after days of deal-making Concordia kept its seat. The attempt is taken as a sign that Concordia reached one of the voters first, and consequences for Ethervolt are expected.
